---
description: Colocate feature UI; put cross-page components and functions in shared folders
globs: web/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Shared vs colocated code (web)

- Components used by **one** page or feature live under `web/src/components/<feature>/`.
- Components used by **two or more** pages live under `web/src/components/shared/`.
- shadcn primitives stay in `web/src/components/ui/` and are imported from there; do not duplicate them.
- Functions/helpers used by **two or more** pages, routes, or features live in `web/src/lib/` (domain folders like `lib/booking`, `lib/ai` are shared).
- Do not put reusable helpers inside a page file or a feature component folder if another route needs them.

```
# ❌ BAD — ChatWindow copied or imported across admin + chat from a feature folder
components/chat/ChatWindow.tsx   // also used by admin
app/admin/page.tsx

# ✅ GOOD
components/shared/ChatWindow.tsx
app/chat/page.tsx
app/admin/page.tsx
```

```
# ❌ BAD — slot helper only in a component
components/admin/AvailabilityForm.tsx  // getAvailableSlots defined here

# ✅ GOOD
lib/booking/slots.ts
```
